The matter is thus: it is known that there is a place above called Eldad and Medad, from where abundance (the

shefa

) descends to the world.

For the two letters א"ל (A"L) are ד (Dad), and the two letters מ"י (M"Y) are also ד (Dad) [as brought in **Likutay Torah** of the Ari, Parashat

Beha’alotcha

].
